"id":"c-shiji-006-shihuang:p064:block05:m0201","start":201,"end":203,"surface":"樂毅","kind":"person","person_id":"gz0_xuu_ont","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-006-shihuang:p064:block05:m0209","start":209,"end":211,"surface":"吳起","kind":"person","person_id":"xzw_df5_9v1","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-006-shihuang:p064:block05:m0212","start":212,"end":214,"surface":"孫臏","kind":"person","person_id":"99a_9ca_6fi","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-006-shihuang:p064:block05:m0215","start":215,"end":217,"surface":"帶佗","kind":"person","person_id":"53n_g5n_wci","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-006-shihuang:p064:block05:m0218","start":218,"end":220,"surface":"兒良","kind":"person","person_id":"dzo_7i3_hdh","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-006-shihuang:p064:block05:m0221","start":221,"end":223,"surface":"王廖","kind":"person","person_id":"x5u_3mf_dc8","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-006-shihuang:p064:block05:m0224","start":224,"end":226,"surface":"田忌","kind":"person","person_id":"ykz_dyf_q7h","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-006-shihuang:p064:block05:m0227","start":227,"end":229,"surface":"廉頗","kind":"person","person_id":"tfz_fnj_ejn","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-006-shihuang:p064:block05:m0230","start":230,"end":232,"surface":"趙奢","kind":"person","person_id":"32l_gy6_4fi","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-006-shihuang:p064:block05:m0263","start":263,"end":267,"surface":"九國之師","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"泛稱、群體或未核指代，不據引文譬喻補造個人。"},{"id":"c-shiji-006-shihuang:p064:block05:m0359","start":359,"end":362,"surface":"孝文王","kind":"person","person_id":"ao3_0fy_d45_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-006-shihuang:p064:block05:m0363","start":363,"end":366,"surface":"莊襄王","kind":"person","person_id":"ao3_0fy_d45_AA","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"source_block_kind":"witness_dd","chapter_id":"c-shiji-006-shihuang","book_id":"b-shiji-006","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-006-shihuang"},{"id":"c-shiji-048-chenshe:p023","text":"孝公既沒，惠文王、武王、昭王蒙故業，因遺策，南取漢中，西舉巴蜀，東割膏腴之地，收要害之郡。諸侯恐懼，會盟而謀弱秦。不愛珍器重寶肥饒之地，以致天下之士。合從締交，相與為一。當此之時，齊有孟嘗，趙有平原，楚有春申，魏有信陵：此四君者，皆明知而忠信，寬厚而愛人，尊賢而重士。約從連衡，兼韓、魏、燕、趙、宋、衛、中山之眾。於是六國之士有甯越、徐尚、蘇秦、杜赫之屬為之謀，齊明、周聚、陳軫、邵滑、樓緩、翟景、蘇厲、樂毅之徒通其意，吳起、孫臏、帶他、兒良、王廖、田忌、廉頗、趙奢之倫制其兵。嘗以什倍之地，百萬之師，仰關而攻秦。秦人開關而延敵，九國之師遁逃而不敢進。秦無亡矢遺鏃之費，而天下固已困矣。於是從散約敗，爭割地而賂秦。秦有余力而制其獘，追亡逐北，伏尸百萬，流血漂櫓，因利乘便，宰割天下，分裂山河，彊國請服，弱國入朝。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"witness_appended_chu_note","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-048-chenshe:m023-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"孝公","kind":"person","person_id":"t1l_80q_ezz","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-048-chenshe:m023-0005","start":5,"end":8,"surface":"惠文王","kind":"person","person_id":"64c_hdt_bl8","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-048-chenshe:m023-0009","start":9,"end":11,"surface":"武王","kind":"person","person_id":"1a2_arl_bzv","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-048-chenshe:m023-0012","start":12,"end":14,"surface":"昭王","kind":"person","person_id":"kih_68x_38t","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-048-chenshe:m023-0092","start":92,"end":94,"surface":"孟嘗","kind":"person","person_id":"2ps_i8p_n0m","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-048-chenshe:m023-0097","start":97,"end":99,"surface":"平原","kind":"person","person_id":"ip6_ebi_1g6","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-048-chenshe:m023-0102","start":102,"end":104,"surface":"春申","kind":"person","person_id":"bci_d32_jrt","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-048-chenshe:m023-0107","start":107,"end":109,"surface":"信陵","kind":"person","person_id":"hdc_c4s_8ox","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-048-chenshe:m023-0111","start":111,"end":113,"surface":"四君","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、官稱、對話或未名者待核；普通動詞、詐稱與矯命不當真實人物身份。"},{"id